Manual (D:\HT9045\_vendor_manuals\安全PLC.pdf = Reer 'Process data mapping for M1S COM Master module V2.0' 8547780 Rev.4, p.28): Modbus FC3/FC4 System I/O at registers 0x400-0x410 (17 registers, low byte = even-numbered byte): 0x400 lo System status, 0x401-0x408 Input status bytes 0-15, 0x409-0x40A Restart, 0x40B-0x40C Fieldbus feedback, 0x40D-0x40E Probe, 0x40F-0x410 OSSD; 0x000-0x001 is the host's WRITE area. Golden reads FC4 0x0000 x11 -> the write area plus undefined registers. Measured read-only on this machine: 0x0000 x11 = 22 zero bytes, unchanged for 20 min; 0x400 x17 = System status 0x01, Input bytes 0x55 0x15 0x10 0x05, Restart byte 0 = 0x04, OSSD 0; control 0x620 (project CRC 0x4D29, date 2026-09-13) non-zero; 0x500 error codes 0.

Code (all same-line edits except the new function at the end of MyPLC_IO_Modbus.cpp): Gerneral.ini [System] SafePlcModel -> iSafePlcModel (cmydef.cpp/.h, read in database.cpp next to SafePlcIO). PLCIOTaskCycle: model 1 requests FC4 0x400 x17; the reply goes through W906_PlcM1SFill, which lays it into golden's InPortData_Byte ([0] System status, [1+n] Input status byte n, [20..21] OSSD bytes 0..1) so golden's bit split, MyLaneIo IOInputBit (Port 0x300+n -> Input byte n via the +1 index) and TMyPLC_IO_Modbus::IsOn stay unchanged. Model 0 = golden, byte for byte. tests/test_myplc_modbus.cpp [4]: the 34 bytes measured on the machine as the reply -> parse and Port 0x300..0x303 mapping (7 checks pass; the request address itself is confirmed by reading the code -- the SIM socket's tx is not reachable from the test).

Machine data (pushed by push_stage's machine_params snapshot): Gerneral.ini + SafePlcModel=1 under SafePlcIO=0 (backup Gerneral.ini.bak_plcmodel_20261006_171604); SafePlcIO stays 0 until the E-STOP / door bits are mapped (the 0x400 watch saw Input byte 4 bit 0 and byte 1 bits 0/2 change 17:03-17:11; EastSun to say what was operated; golden MyLaneIo only maps Port 0x300-0x303 = Input bytes 0-3).

o2 full build 0 errors; ctest 384/402, failures = the known list; production_audit passes; Debug and release wb_serve rebuilt. WORKLOG item 135.

